### AxolotDB — project rules ###

# Build artifacts and logs
build/
build_*.txt
*.log
*.pdb
*.obj
*.ilk
/.claude/
/.kilo/
# Local database files produced by tests / the CLI
*.db
*.db-wal

# Competitive Programming Helper (VS Code extension)
.cph/

# Notes and working documents stay local; the architecture record ships.
# Scratch notes and progress reports outside docs/ are still ignored.
# `!docs/**/*.md` rather than `!docs/*.md`: the latter is only one directory
# deep and leaves docs/phases/*.md ignored, which is N11 again.
*.md
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!docs/**/*.md

# Local sanitizer build tree
build-asan/
build-cov/
build-tidy/
build-clean/

# Test result / coverage files
*.json
*.dummy
coverage.info

# Scratch scripts and helpers (kept local, not shipped)
scripts/
